					Id.
					<u>Av.</u>
					1503
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰμώξει μακρά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					111
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Epit.</u>
				528
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολάκων οἰμωξομένων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					1033
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πονηροῦ σοφιστοῦ καὶ οἰμωξομένου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					35.40
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐᾶν οἰμώζειν</span> 'let go
			hang', <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				44.8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> trans., <i>pity, bewail,</i> c. acc., <i><span class="en">
